WEBVTT

00:00:07.789 --> 00:00:08.569
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:09.469 --> 00:00:12.477
<v><b>A:</b></v> A pencil is cheaper than a pen.

00:00:14.465 --> 00:00:15.185
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:16.098 --> 00:00:18.646
<v><b>B:</b></v> June is shorter than July.

00:00:20.697 --> 00:00:21.410
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:22.354 --> 00:00:25.755
<v><b>A:</b></v> The kitchen is dirtier than the living room.

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:28.554
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:29.474 --> 00:00:32.314
<v><b>B:</b></v> Apples are healthier than cookies.

00:00:34.313 --> 00:00:35.177
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:36.116 --> 00:00:39.344
<v><b>A:</b></v> Switzerland is colder than France.

00:00:41.321 --> 00:00:42.201
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:43.112 --> 00:00:46.413
<v><b>B:</b></v> K2 is higher than Kilimanjaro.